<div class="swag_countdown_timer">
{% render 'countdown-timer-swag-series' %}
</div>
<div class="swag_series_top"  style="background:#000 url({{'swagseries-bg.png' | asset_url}}) no-repeat bottom center">
	<div class="page-width">
    	<div class="top_img"><img src="{{'top-logo.png' | asset_url}}" alt=""></div>
        <h2><span>Enter To Win</span><br />The Meadows at Mystic Lake<br/> Swag Series Event</h2>
        <p>Enter To Win A Free Entry $777 Value</p>
        <div class="button"><a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="var _klOnsite = window._klOnsite || []; _klOnsite.push(['openForm', 'UEjdrz']);">ENTER TO WIN</a></div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="swag_series_text_bg">
	<div class="page-width">
	<div class="swagseries_left">
    	<div class="text"><img src="{{'mystic-lakes.jpeg' | asset_url}}" alt=""></div>
        <h4>The Meadows at Mystic Lake</h4>
        <div class="icon"><img src="{{'map-icon.png' | asset_url}}" alt=""> Prior Lake, MN</div>
        <div class="icon"><img src="{{'deta-icon.png' | asset_url}}" alt=""> September 11, 2023</div>
        <div class="icon"><img src="{{'time-icon.png' | asset_url}}" alt=""> 9 am Shotgun</div>
        <div class="perteam">
        	<p>Tournament Entry:</p>
			<span>$777</span> /per team
        </div>
        <div class="perteam">
        	<p>Optional Team Skins & Pins Game:</p>
			<span>$100</span> /per team
        </div>
        
        <p>Includes: Gross Skins, Net Skins, & Black Bag Par 3 Closet to the Pin Contests<br /><i>Must be paid prior to event start date and via Venmo only</i></p>
        
        <p>Registration open February 1 for <a href="#">AGT Rewards</a> Members and February 15th to the General Public</p>        
    </div>
    <div class="swagseries_right">
    	<p style="padding:0;">Tournament Format:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>2 Player Four Ball - teams of 2 players, each playing their own ball, will compete in a Gross and Net format simultaneously. The lower score between the two players is the score for the team on that hole. For the Net completion, 70% of a players course handicap will be used. Course handicap will be calculated using a players handicap index and applying it to the slope/rating for the set of tees played.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Tournament Tee Times: 1 pm Shotgun</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Pairings will be e-mailed and posted on the website 7-10 days prior to the event.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Tournament Prize Payouts (Gross & Net Divisions):</p>
        <ul>
        <li>1st place: Team Entry to National Championship hosted at Big Cedar Lodge</li>
        <li>2nd place $800 Visa Gift Card ($400 per player)</li>
        <li>3rd place: $400 Visa Gift Card ($200 per player)</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Tournament Eligibility:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>No membership required for participation; <a href="https://agt.golfgenius.com/pages/6780858323559287813">AGT Profile Required</a></li>
        <li>All players with active amateur status are eligible for qualifier event.</li>
        <li>No handicap is required, unless you wish to place in the Net Division, then a verifiable USG handicap will be required and confirmed</li>
        <li>If a player does not have a verifable handicap, they will play as a 0 handicap.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Tournament Local Rules:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>USGA Rules are in effect, unless superseded by <a href="https://agt.golfgenius.com/pages/9134812096066784679">Local Rules</a></li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Tournament Estimated Yardages (subject to change per venue)</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Men: 6,668 yards - Blue</li>
        <li>Men 55+: 6,318 yards - White</li>
        <li>Women: 5,823 yards - Green</li>
        <li>Women 55+ : 5,293 yards - Gold</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

